### PolyTrack API Tests
### Install REST Client extension in VS Code (by Humao)
### Then click "Send Request" above each request

### ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
### STEP 1 — Login (run this first, copy the token below)
### ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

# @name login
POST http://localhost:5030/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "admin@polytrack.com",
  "password": "Admin@123456"
}

### ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
### PASTE YOUR TOKEN FROM ABOVE RESPONSE HERE
### Replace the token value below with your actual token
### ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

@token =eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9..FLWKskD9I7id4j4OV6JLqP9MXRZ2UT-K-qaG2MGEAVc

### ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
### TEST 1 — Create a project
### Expected: 201 Created with project id
### ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

# @name createProject
POST http://localhost:5030/api/projects
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "name": "Medieval Environment Pack",
  "description": "Full medieval castle environment with props",
  "projectCode": "PROJ-001",
  "projectType": "environment",
  "status": "active",
  "priority": "high",
  "startDate": "2024-01-15",
  "endDate": "2024-03-15",
  "budgetAmount": 5000,
  "currency": "INR"
}

### ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
### PASTE PROJECT ID FROM ABOVE RESPONSE HERE
### ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

@projectId = PASTE_PROJECT_ID_HERE

### ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
### TEST 2 — Get all projects
### Expected: 200 OK with list containing your project
### ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

GET http://localhost:5030/api/projects
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###

### ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
### TEST 2b — Get all projects with filters
### Expected: 200 OK filtered list
### ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

GET http://localhost:5030/api/projects?status=active
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###

GET http://localhost:5030/api/projects?search=medieval
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###

GET http://localhost:5030/api/projects?priority=high
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###

### ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
### TEST 3 — Get single project
### Expected: 200 OK with full project details
### ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

GET http://localhost:5030/api/projects/{{projectId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###

### ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
### TEST 4 — Update project
### Expected: 200 OK
### ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

PUT http://localhost:5030/api/projects/{{projectId}}
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "status": "planning",
  "completionPercent": 10
}

###

### ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
### TEST 5 — Get project stats
### Expected: 200 OK with all zeros (no tasks/assets yet)
### ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

GET http://localhost:5030/api/projects/{{projectId}}/stats
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###

### ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
### TEST 6 — Delete (soft) project
### Expected: 200 OK - sets status to cancelled
### ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

DELETE http://localhost:5030/api/projects/{{projectId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###

### ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
### BONUS — Verify delete worked (status should be cancelled)
### ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

GET http://localhost:5030/api/projects/{{projectId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###
